ay solo or team up with a friend in local co-opWe've been working on Mingle for quite some time, and we're excited to finally share the full game on Steam.In the meantime, you can play our free demo, and if you like it, wishlist Mi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:39:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035464","verified_at":"2026-10-23T12:06:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3782840-1846651706684047","game_id":"steam-3782840","kind":"announcement","title":"Mingle is Coming to Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Mingle is part of Steam Next Fest, and our free demo is out now!Jump into a crowd of quirky little characters and find your identical twin. Each successful match transforms you into someone new, with a new surprising way to play in each level.Play solo or team up with a friend in local co-opWe're a two-person indie team from New Zealand, and we'd love to hear what you think.If you enjoyed the demo, we’d love it if you leave us some feedback or wishlist Mingle to support us ahead of launch!Thanks","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T08:04:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684047","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3782840-1846018067932612","game_id":"steam-3782840","kind":"announcement","title":"Mingle is in the Unmistakable Festival!","summary":"Mingle is part of Unmistakable Festival, a celebration of art and animation in video games.The festival runs from October 8-12, featuring a daily livestream that takes you behind the scenes to see how the games' artwork was created.Watch the stream on October 12 to see how we bring Mingle's little characters to life!Check out Unmistakable Festival on Steam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T08:56:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932612","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3782840-1835236783557385","game_id":"steam-3782840","kind":"announcement","title":"5,000 Wishlists!","summary":"Thank you for 5,000 wishlists!!!This is a huge milestone for Mingle, and it wouldn't have happened without your support! Thank you to everyone who has clicked that wishlist button, to everyone who let us participate in showcases, to everyone who has followed our journey so far and shown your support in any way! Thank you thank you thank you!!SteamDiscordYoutube InstagramTiktokBlueskyX","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-10T12:23:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783557385","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3782840-1834602721194931","game_id":"steam-3782840","kind":"announcement","title":"Mingle Release window with Frosty Games Fest 2026","summary":"Mingle was featured in the Frosty Games Fest as part of the Summer Game Fest! https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45423962-Frosty-Games-Celebration/sale/frostygamescelebration2026Also...Mingle is coming out Q4 at the end of this year! Thank you all so much for supporting the game :)Cheers! Shannon and Sam.SteamDiscordYoutube InstagramTiktokBlueskyX","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T22:27:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194931","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3782840-1832065502814812","game_id":"steam-3782840","kind":"announcement","title":"Mingle is in the ANZ Indie Showcase","summary":"Mingle was featured in the ANZ Indie Showcase stream where we showed off a brand new trailer. Check it out below :)SteamDiscordYoutube InstagramTiktokBlueskyX","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-08T11:32:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502814812","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3782840-1829528821307744","game_id":"steam-3782840","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo out now!","summary":"The Mingle demo is out now!Download Mingle DemoJump into a the 4 unique levels and see if you can 3-star them all. Each time you finish a level you’ll meet a new character, each eager to tell you something strange.There’s also local co-op if you want to play with a friend on one keyboard, or with two controllers.If you have any feedback, you can fill out this short form or send us a message on Discord.Happy mingling :)Shannon and Sam (Cookiecrayon)SteamDiscordYoutube InstagramTiktokBlueskyX","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-09T17:28:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821307744","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3782840-1829528821306362","game_id":"steam-3782840","kind":"announcement","title":"We’re in the Steam Hidden Object Fest!","summary":"We’re part of the Steam Hidden Object fest!Annnnd the...DEMO LAUNCHES TOMORROW! ...or in a few hours depending on your timezone :)Come back tomorrow to try it out and a whole bunch of hidden object game goodies.Cheers! Shannon and Sam (Cookiecrayon)SteamDiscordYoutube InstagramTiktokBlueskyX","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-09T11:31:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821306362","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3782840-1828894815554370","game_id":"steam-3782840","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is coming soon!","summary":"The Mingle demo is on its way. Jump into a few levels, play co-op with a friend, and meet some minglers while you’re at it. There’s also a handy feedback form, or slide into our Discord and tell us how much you love it :)Keep an eye out… it’s dropping sooooon.Discord Youtube Instagram Tiktok Bluesky X","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-01T10:42:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815554370","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3782840-1814309641392416","game_id":"steam-3782840","kind":"announcement","title":"Join the Cookiecrayon Discord!","summary":"We’ve launched our Discord!It’s a space for players of Mingle and our other games to chat, share ideas, give feedback, and help shape our games together ☺️Join the Cookiecrayon Discord: https://discord.gg/NAreGExMMW","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-21T23:47:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641392416","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3782840-1813041031351723","game_id":"steam-3782840","kind":"announcement","title":"1,000 Wishlists!","summary":"We've hit 1,000 wishlists on Steam!Big thanks to everyone supporting Mingle! With over 140,000 early prototype demo players on Itch, and over 30,000 players enjoying the special release of the motion-controlled version of the full game on Nex Playground, seeing this excitement carry over to Steam means everything to us. We're just getting started, and we can't wait to grow this community together!Don't forget to follow our socials for more updates about Mingle and other releases.Website, X, Blue","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-13T22:44:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813041031351723","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3782840-1811138915539669","game_id":"steam-3782840","kind":"announcement","title":"Made in New Zealand!","summary":"Mingle is part of the Made in New Zealand 2025 festival on Steam. A showcase of games created in Aotearoa, each with its own personality waiting to be discovered. The event runs until September 29th, so head over and wishlist your new favorites.Check out the event here: https://store.steampowered.com/sale/NZGames2025Don’t forget to follow our socials for more updates about Mingle and other releases!WebsiteXBlueskyInstagramTiktokYoutube","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-23T02:09:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811138915539669","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3782840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:50Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3782840":"2026-10-26T10:59:51Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3782840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:50Z"},"4573340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:5